  "id": "spanish-potato-salad",
  "name": "Spanish Potato Salad",
  "subtitle": "Tender potatoes with peppers, olives, and garlic dressing",
  "description": "A bright, savory potato salad combining tender red potatoes with crisp pepper, olives, herbs, and a simple vinegar dressing.",
